    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You don’t just hold the line—you redefine “breaking” as “bending gracefully.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, you can use your <strong>action</strong> to invoke an Unbreakable Front.</p><ul><li>You create a <strong>6 squares-radius aura</strong> centered on you that lasts for <strong>1 minute</strong> and moves with you.</li><li>Allies in the aura gain <strong>advantage</strong> on defense check against being <strong>Shaken</strong> or <strong>charmed</strong>.</li><li>Allies in the aura gain a <strong>+1 bonus to Guard</strong>.</li><li>When an ally in the aura succeeds on a check against being Shaken or charmed, they gain temporary Integrity equal to your <strong>tier</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>OP Echo.</strong> If a major conflict or uprising is weathered under the Unbreakable Front without your side losing a hex or unit to outright collapse, your faction may reduce <strong>Attrition</strong> by 1 and gains <strong>+1 Diplomacy OP</strong> as the story becomes “we bent, but we did not break.”</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
